            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Casein is better for texture because it thickens and holds water, giving a dense, gelato-like pint. Whey blends taste closer to a milkshake and often have bigger flavor ranges but freeze lighter and icier. A whey-casein blend is a good compromise if you want both flavor and body."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How much xanthan gum should I add to a Creami pint?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
