    </div>

    <!-- Table of Contents -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-8">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          In This Guide
        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#why-powder-matters" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. Why the Powder Matters</a>
          <a href="#how-we-picked" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. How We Picked</a>
          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. Our Top Picks</a>
          <a href="#casein-vs-whey" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. Casein vs Whey vs Plant</a>
          <a href="#base-recipe" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. A Simple Protein Base</a>
          <a href="#thickeners" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Xanthan, Guar and Pudding Mix</a>
          <a href="#fix-texture" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Fixing Icy or Powdery Pints</a>
          <a href="#flavors" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. Flavors and Mix-Ins</a>
          <a href="#nutrition" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">9. Protein and Calories per Pint</a>
          <a href="#mistakes" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">10. Common Mistakes</a>
